Custom menus for code-server

Add configurable menu items to the File, Go and Help menubar menus from a
YAML file passed via `--custom-menu-file`. Each entry targets one menu
(`file`, `go` or `help`) and contains one or more groups. A group is
positioned at the top or bottom of the menu (default `bottom`); its
entries keep their declared order and each new group is rendered as a
separate block, separated from the next by a divider. Entry labels can be
localized per UI language and link to a relative path or absolute URL.

